{
  "id": "1SA.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Sang'Weli 10",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo kwitīīlwa maguta na Sang'weli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Sang'weli ūsola jūpa ya maguta ūng'witīīla ha ntwe ū Saulo, hanuma ūmbipa; ūng'wīla, “Ū SEEBA atakwitīīlile maguta ūbize ntongeeji wa banhū ba wingīji wakwe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūlīnge a halī nene henaha, ī lelo īyī ūlū ūlashike Zeliza bbihī na shigila sha ng'wa Laheli ū kū lūbīmbī lwa sī ya banhū ba ng'wa Benjamini, ūkūmanhya na banhū babīlī. Bakūkūwīla, “Ī nzobe ījo walī wajile kūjikooba jilongile, nīyo ī haha ū so ooyile ū kūjiiganika ī nzobe, wandije kūkoya ū mu maganiko kūlwa nguno ying'we; akwibūjaga wei ng'wenekīlī gīkī, ‘Ī gete nabeeje masala kī nampandīke ū ng'witūnja wane?’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ūlū wīnga a henaho ūkūshimīza ūūkashika kū ntī ntaale gwa Tabooli. A henaho ūkūmanhya na bagosha badatū balīlinha kūja Beeseli kū numba ya ng'wa Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kū numba ya ng'wa Mulungu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, kūlī Mulungu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ūmò wabo akūbiza abūūkije baana ba mbūli badatū, ūngī migatī idatū, ū ūngī shisaabo sha divai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benabo bakūkūgīsha, hama būkwinha migatī idatū; nang'ho ūkwīyanukūla kūfuma ū mu makono gabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ūkūja kū lūgūlū lo Mulungu; īlīko koi ng'hambī ya bashilikale ba Bafilisiti. Ūlū ūgwegeela ū nzengo, ūkūmanhya na'iganda lya bahangi bakūshimīzaga hamò kūfuma kwipandī lya higūlya, kūnū bakūhangaga; ū kū būtongi wabo bakūbiza ko batūji ba malimba, shitumba, mbiilūlū, na ndono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Moyo o ng'wa SEEBA akūkwikīīla na nguzu wandye kūhanga hamò nabo, nīyo ūkūgalūchiwa ū bize munhū ūngī nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū wībona ī yenīyī yashikīīla, ītaga būlī mhayo ūyo nkono gwako gūlaabone, nguno ū Mulungu akūbiza alī hamò nang'ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūkūtonga kūja Giligaali; nū nene nakwiza natūūleka; nize kūfunya shitambò sha kūpemvwa na shakwinha sha būsangī; gwike shikwigeleelilwe ūnilindīīle ikanza lya shikū mpungatī, kūshisha nize hū nakūkūwīla ī yakwīta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo kūbiza hamò na bahangi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo aho wagalūka gīkī alekane nū Sang'weli, ū Mulungu ūngalūcha ī ng'holò yakwe; pyī ī shimanīkījo shenīsho shūshikīīla ū lūshikū lwenūlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho baashika ū kū lūgūlū lo Mulungu, ūmanhya na'iganda lya bahangi bakūshimīzaga hamò; hūna ū Moyo o ng'wa Mulungu ūng'wikīīla na nguzu, nang'hwe ūdimana nabo ūja akūhangaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo baalī bandeebile na kale aho bamona alī ng'wigelè lya bahangi akūhangaga hamò nabo, būyibūūja; “Bing'we ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Kishi wilongelagwa mhayo kī? Ū Saulo nang'hwe wabizile ūmò wa bahangi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munhū nebe wikalaga ī mhandī jenījo ūshosha akūbūūjaga, “Al'ū saabo ni nani?” Na lūūlū kwandīja henaho banhū būyipūgūla bakūhayaga, “Ū Saulo nang'hwe wabizile ūmò wa bahangi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo aho ooya ū kūhanga ūlinha ajile ū kwipandī ī lya higūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ise ndo o ng'wa Saulo ūmūūja ū Saulo nū ntūmami wakwe, “Bing'we ng'walī ng'wajile halī?” Ū Saulo ūshosha ūhaya, “Kūkooba nzobe, alīyo aho twajigayiwa tūja kūlī Sang'weli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ise ndo o ng'wa Saulo ūmūūja na būkalalwa alīhaya, “Ali niwīlage īyo wamuwīlile ū Sang'weli!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūhaya, “Akatūwīla ī ya nzobe, gīkī ītizūtūkoya nguno jilongile.” Alīyo ūleka ū kūng'wīla ū ise ūmo Sang'weli akang'wīlīla mihayo ya būtemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo kwanīlwa kūbiza ntemi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli ūbitana a Baisilaeli a bose kwiza Misipa kū libilinga lya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla, “Ū SEEBA Mulungu wa Baisilaeli alīhaya gīkī, ‘A bing'we Baisilaeli nakang'wīnja Misili, nūng'wīnja kūfuma mu būsugi wa Bamisili, na kūfuma mu būlī mahanga ayo gang'wiboneelaga.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī haha ng'wanemile ū Mulungu wing'we, ūyo akūmupījaga kūfuma mu mayanga na būpīna wing'we bose. Ng'wamalile kūhaya gīkī, ‘Biya twinhage ntemi wa kūtūsuga.’ Alilūūlū, ī haha egeelagi kūlī SEEBA, būlī bene mu ng'anda na ndūgū jabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli aho wajeegeleja ī ng'anda ja Baisilaeli ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, lūūsolwa lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini ūlwegeleja kūlenganīla na ndūgū jabo, lūūsolwa lūdūgū lwa ng'wa Matili; ū kū ng'halīlo yaho ūsolwa Saulo ng'witūnja o ng'wa Kishi. Alīyo aho bankooba hoi būngayiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū būmūūja hangī ū SEEBA balīhaya, “Ū munhū ng'wenūyo wizaga a henaha?” Ū SEEBA ūhaya, “Alīho wibisaga mu miligo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būpeela ko būūkang'wenha; aho wiza kwīmīīla a ha gatī ya banhū ūbakīlīīla pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli ūbawīla a banhū, “Mulīmona ū munhū ūyo wasolilwe na SEEBA? Ū mu banhū bose atīho ūngī wa kūbiza gītī wei.” Hūna a banhū būhamuka n'ilaka lya higūlya balīhaya, “Kūlaga ūhangame ntemi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ū Sang'weli ūbawīla a banhū ī mihayo ya būtemi īyo yigelile bīmane, hanuma wīyandīka mu shitabo, ūshitūūla kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. Hūna ū Sang'weli ūbalaga a banhū būja kaya, būlī ng'wene kū ng'wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū Saulo ūja Gibea kū ng'wakwe; bagosha ba nguzu bamò na bamò abo Mulungu akabakuumya ng'holò jabo būnondeela. ",
          "type": "text",
